{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/52e1821786c54d4e0a56eec39745f43b.webp?t=1761837710\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/52e1821786c54d4e0a56eec39745f43b.poster.avif?t=1761837710\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=175 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mall Simulator is a chill first-person simulation where you will experience a giant mall tycoon with various stores that you run yourself:</strong>  <br><br><strong>\ud83d\udc55 Clothing\u2003\u26bd Sports\u2003\ud83d\udcbb Tech\u2003\ud83e\uddf8 Toys\u2003\ud83d\uded2 Supermarket\u2003\ud83d\udc84 Cosmetics  <br>\ud83c\udfac Cinema\u2003\ud83c\udf54 Burger Shop\u2003\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Arcade\u2003\ud83c\udfe0 Home Goods\u2003\ud83c\udfae Game Store  <br>\ud83e\udd50 Bakery\u2003\ud83d\udc8d Jewelry\u2003\ud83c\udf38 Florist\u2003\ud83c\udf63 Sushi Bar\u2003\ud83e\udd64 Vending Machines\u2003\ud83d\udcb5 ATMs</strong><br><br><strong>\u2026and so much more to explore in your mega mall!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/55ba77c14eb894118b5f2190b70f3dc7.avif?t=1761837710\" width=800 height=101 /></span>Design matters! Create the best design for your mall and manage your stores. Showcase your best-seller stores and create the perfect mall for your customers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.poster.avif?t=1761837710\" width=748 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180150/extras/37eeae65d6b3464ec5efc16593df5b7b.webm?t=1761837